1
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,100
I wrote a letter, Marrakech, I gave it

2
00:01:22,100 --> 00:01:22,690
everything.

3
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,350
I'll read it to you.

4
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:28,120
We'll debrief afterwards, OK?

5
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:29,930
"Dear neighbours,

6
00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:31,340
my activities as an entertainer take me,

7
00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:33,190
unexpectedly,

8
00:01:34,810 --> 00:01:36,430
away from Parisian lands on the

9
00:01:36,430 --> 00:01:37,400
aforementioned dates."

10
00:01:38,910 --> 00:01:40,400
Not easy to slip in, "aforementioned".

11
00:01:41,930 --> 00:01:42,480
"However,

12
00:01:43,030 --> 00:01:44,470
your invitation finds a favourable echo

13
00:01:44,470 --> 00:01:45,320
in me.

14
00:01:46,130 --> 00:01:47,170
And as soon as I return from my Burgundy

15
00:01:47,170 --> 00:01:47,880
estate,

16
00:01:49,050 --> 00:01:49,780
I,

17
00:01:50,330 --> 00:01:51,440
Kevin de Adams,

18
00:01:52,890 --> 00:01:54,170
