19
00:01:54,170 --> 00:01:55,790
over a beverage or a wild boar at

20
00:01:55,790 --> 00:01:57,480
our mutual convenience.

21
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:13,860
In the meantime, dear neighbours, please

22
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:14,920
accept the assurance of my

23
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:16,590
deepest consideration.

24
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:18,820
Yours truly. Long live France and long live

25
00:02:18,820 --> 00:02:20,130
Morocco."
